      },
      "text": "FIRST-ORDER EXAMPLE:\n  Plant:     ẏ = -a_p y + b_p u    (a_p, b_p unknown)\n  Ref model: ẏm = -am ym + bm r    (am > 0, bm known — desired response)\n  Control:   u = θ₁(t)r + θ₂(t)y  (parameterized)"
    },
