      },
      "text": "LYAPUNOV-BASED MRAC (provably stable):\n  For the first-order example:\n  Define parameter errors: φ₁ = θ₁ - θ₁*, φ₂ = θ₂ - θ₂*\n  Error dynamics:  ė = -am·e + b_p(φ₁r + φ₂y)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md#015",
      "path": [
        "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
