        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Adaptive Control",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Lyapunov function: V = e²/2 + b_p/(2γ)(φ₁² + φ₂²)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md#016",
      "path": [
        "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
