      },
      "text": "INTERPRETATION: Signal φ must be \"rich\" enough in all directions\n  For n-parameter system: reference r must contain at least n distinct frequencies\n  Sinusoid at single frequency → only 1D excitation → only 1 parameter identifiable"
    },
