      },
      "text": "```\nLINEAR REGRESSION MODEL:\n  y(t) = φᵀ(t)θ + noise(t)\n  φ(t) = [y(t-1), ..., y(t-na), u(t-1), ..., u(t-nb)]  (regression vector)\n  θ = [a₁,...,ana, b₁,...,bnb]ᵀ  (plant parameters to identify)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md#034",
      "path": [
        "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:control-theory:08-adaptive-control, git-history:control-theory:08-adaptive-control]",
        "canonical_path": "control-theory/08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[adaptive, control]",
        "current_path": "control-theory/08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:control-theory:adaptive-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "control-theory",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[adaptive, control]",
        "section": "control-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Adaptive Control",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RLS UPDATE (recursive form, avoids matrix inversion):\n  ê(t) = y(t) - φᵀ(t)θ̂(t-1)            (prediction error)\n  L(t) = P(t-1)φ(t) / [λ + φᵀ(t)P(t-1)φ(t)]   (gain vector)\n  θ̂(t) = θ̂(t-1) + L(t)ê(t)             (parameter update)\n  P(t) = [I - L(t)φᵀ(t)]P(t-1)/λ        (covariance update)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md#035",
      "path": [
        "08-ADAPTIVE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:control-theory:08-adaptive-control, git-history:control-theory:08-adaptive-control]",
