        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Adaptive Control",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "λ ∈ (0, 1]: forgetting factor\n  λ = 1:   infinite memory (batch least squares in recursive form)\n  λ < 1:   exponential forgetting, weight recent data more\n           effective memory ~ 1/(1-λ) samples\n  Typical: λ = 0.95-0.99 for time-varying systems"
    }
